mand-X, lends its [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]living-note tiers to `[[` link completion so machinery and zorg [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]satellites stop crowding the 20 suggestion slots, and a line-less [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]note open records a Vim jump so `<C-o>` returns to where Bryan was.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]5[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]2[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202611/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]note_goto_followups.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202611/note_goto_followups.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-mb[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-mb/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob-cli: shared note tiers and `capture-complete -A` archive [/bold #D7AFFF] [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]catalog[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]cli-archive-scope[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cli-archive-scope: give `note_catalog` one shared path-tier predicate [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF](living, archive, hidden), add an archive catalog of top-level done/ [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]notes, superseded library folders, and zorg daily satellites, and serve [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]it behind a new `capture-complete -A/--archived-notes` flag with an [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`archived` marker; help, docs, and tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob-cli: living notes first in vault-wide `[[` link completion[bold black on #87D7FF][/bold #D7AFFF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]cli-link-tiers[dim] · [dim][/dim]after cli-archive-scope[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cli-link-tiers: tag every `[[` note-index entry with the shared tier and[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]order (or drop, per decision link_tiers) archive and hidden notes after [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]living matches in `[[note`, `[[##`, `[[^^`, and record link-value [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]suggestions, leaving target-scoped completion and link resolution [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]unchanged.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Mac: Recent group in the empty `//` picker from an app-local [/bold #D7AFFF] [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]open log[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]mac-recent-notes[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac-recent-notes: record each successful `//` open in an app-local, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]schema-versioned open log, show up to eight recently opened notes as a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Recent section after Today in the empty Notes picker, add a Settings [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]action that clears the log, and land green on macOS CI.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Mac: Command-X toggles Go To · Archive in the `//` picker[/bold #D7AFFF]     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]mac-archive-scope[dim] · [dim][/dim]after cli-archive-scope, mac-recent-notes[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac-archive-scope: claim the reserved Command-X in Notes to toggle a Go [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]To · Archive scope fed by `capture-complete --archived-notes`, with [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]stale-safe scope state, archive rows and groups, an old-bob hint, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]generated fixtures, docs, and green exact-SHA macOS CI.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob-plugins: line-less bob-open-notes opens record a `<C-o>` [/bold #D7AFFF] [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]jump[/bold #D7AFFF]\